        <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <a href="#what-electric-does-well" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">1. What Electric Does Well</a>
